---
// Precintos.astro - Componente para la sección de precintos automáticos
---

<section class="precintos-section" id="precintos">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="precintos-content">
        <div class="precintos-text animate-on-scroll">
          <h2 class="section-title">Precintos automáticos: 100 etiquetas en 25 segundos</h2>
          <p class="precintos-description">
            Olvídate de abrir el software del fabricante y perder tiempo diseñando etiquetas manualmente. TracingPBA conecta directamente con tu impresora térmica y genera precintos personalizados con todos los datos necesarios.
          </p>
          
          <div class="precintos-features">
            <div class="feature-item">
              <div class="feature-icon">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12"></polyline>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="feature-text">
                <h3>Velocidad sin precedentes</h3>
                <p>En lugar de minutos, genera todas tus etiquetas del día en segundos. Mejora la productividad del personal.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="feature-item">
              <div class="feature-icon">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
                  <path d="M12 8v4l3 3"></path>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="feature-text">
                <h3>Datos automáticos</h3>
                <p>Código de cliente, número consecutivo, fechas de beneficio y vencimiento, todo calculado automáticamente.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="feature-item">
              <div class="feature-icon">
                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
                  <circle cx="8.5" cy="8.5" r="1.5"></circle>
                  <path d="M20.4 14.5L16 10 4 20"></path>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div class="feature-text">
                <h3>Plantillas para maquila</h3>
                <p>Múltiples diseños de etiquetas por cliente, con la información correcta según tus acuerdos comerciales.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="precintos-impact">
            <div class="impact-metric">
              <div class="metric-value">+85%</div>
              <div class="metric-label">menos tiempo en impresión</div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="impact-clients">
              <div class="client-logos">
                <span>Compatible con:</span>
                <div class="logo">Zebra</div>
                <div class="logo">TSC</div>
                <div class="logo">SATO</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="precintos-visual animate-on-scroll">
          <div class="printer-container">
            <div class="printer-body">
              <div class="printer-top">
                <div class="printer-indicator"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="printer-slot">
                <div class="precinto-label" style="--delay: 0s">
                  <div class="precinto-content">
                    <div class="precinto-header">
                      <div class="precinto-logo">PBA</div>
                      <div class="precinto-id">T-1234</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="precinto-data">
                      <div class="precinto-item">Cliente: C-567</div>
                      <div class="precinto-item">Fecha: 19/04/2025</div>
                      <div class="precinto-item">Lote: L-789</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="precinto-barcode"></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="precinto-label" style="--delay: 2s">
                  <div class="precinto-content">
                    <div class="precinto-header">
                      <div class="precinto-logo">PBA</div>
                      <div class="precinto-id">T-1235</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="precinto-data">
                      <div class="precinto-item">Cliente: C-567</div>
                      <div class="precinto-item">Fecha: 19/04/2025</div>
                      <div class="precinto-item">Lote: L-789</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="precinto-barcode"></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="precinto-label" style="--delay: 4s">
                  <div class="precinto-content">
                    <div class="precinto-header">
                      <div class="precinto-logo">PBA</div>
                      <div class="precinto-id">T-1236</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="precinto-data">
                      <div class="precinto-item">Cliente: C-567</div>
                      <div class="precinto-item">Fecha: 19/04/2025</div>
                      <div class="precinto-item">Lote: L-789</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="precinto-barcode"></div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="printer-base"></div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="printer-counter">
              <div class="counter-value">100</div>
              <div class="counter-label">etiquetas</div>
              <div class="counter-time">25s</div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="command-screen">
              <div class="command-header">
                <div class="command-controls">
                  <span></span>
                  <span></span>
                  <span></span>
                </div>
                <div class="command-title">Sistema TracingPBA</div>
              </div>
              <div class="command-body">
                <div class="command-line">$ iniciando_impresión</div>
                <div class="command-line">$ conectando_con_impresora</div>
                <div class="command-line">$ preparando_100_precintos</div>
                <div class="command-line">$ enviando_datos...</div>
                <div class="command-line blink">█</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <!-- Elementos decorativos -->
          <div class="data-flow">
            <div class="data-line flow1"></div>
            <div class="data-line flow2"></div>
            <div class="data-dot dot1"></div>
            <div class="data-dot dot2"></div>
            <div class="data-dot dot3"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <style>
    /* Estilos base de la sección */
    .precintos-section {
      background-color: var(--color-dark-blue);
      padding: 6rem 0;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    
    .precintos-section::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      background-image: 
        radial-gradient(circle at 20% 30%, rgba(59, 223, 180, 0.1) 0%, transparent 50%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 80% 70%, rgba(59, 223, 180, 0.1) 0%, transparent 50%);
      opacity: 0.6;
      z-index: 1;
    }
    
    .precintos-content {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(450px, 1fr));
      gap: 4rem;
      align-items: center;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }
    
    /* Estilos del texto */
    .precintos-text {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }
    
    .section-title {
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      position: relative;
      color: white;
    }
    
    .section-title::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      bottom: -10px;
      left: 0;
      width: 80px;
      height: 3px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--tracingpba-teal), transparent);
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(59, 223, 180, 0.7);
    }
    
    .precintos-description {
      font-size: 1.125rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }
    
    .precintos-features {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }
    
    .feature-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }
    
    .feature-icon {
      flex-shrink: 0;
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background-color: rgba(59, 223, 180, 0.1);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: var(--tracingpba-teal);
      box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1), 0 0 5px rgba(59, 223, 180, 0.2);
    }
    
    .feature-text h3 {
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: white;
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
    
    .feature-text p {
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin: 0;
    }
    
    .precintos-impact {
      display: flex;
      gap: 2rem;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    
    .impact-metric {
      background: rgba(10, 46, 54, 0.5);
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(59, 223, 180, 0.2);
      padding: 1.5rem;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }
    
    .impact-metric:hover {
      transform: translateY(-5px);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2), 0 0 15px rgba(59, 223, 180, 0.2);
      border-color: var(--tracingpba-teal);
    }
    
    .metric-value {
      font-size: 2.5rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--tracingpba-teal);
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
    
    .metric-label {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    }
    
    .impact-clients {
      background: rgba(10, 46, 54, 0.3);
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(59, 223, 180, 0.1);
      padding: 1.25rem;
    }
    
    .client-logos {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 1rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    
    .client-logos span {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    }
    
    .logo {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: white;
      background: rgba(59, 223, 180, 0.1);
      padding: 0.35rem 0.8rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(59, 223, 180, 0.2);
    }
    
    /* Estilos de la visualización de impresora */
    .precintos-visual {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }
    
    .printer-container {
      position: relative;
      max-width: 500px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    
    .printer-body {
      background-color: #2a2a30;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4), 0 0 30px rgba(59, 223, 180, 0.2);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    
    .printer-top {
      height: 30px;
      background-color: #222228;
      border-radius: 6px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 0 15px;
    }
    
    .printer-indicator {
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background-color: var(--tracingpba-teal);
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(59, 223, 180, 0.7);
      animation: blink 2s infinite;
    }
    
    @keyframes blink {
      0%, 100% {
        opacity: 1;
      }
      50% {
        opacity: 0.5;
      }
    }
    
    .printer-slot {
      background-color: #1a1a20;
      border-radius: 6px;
      min-height: 200px;
      padding: 15px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
      position: relative;
    }
    
    .printer-base {
      height: 15px;
      background-color: #222228;
      border-radius: 0 0 6px 6px;
      margin-top: 15px;
    }
    
    .precinto-label {
      width: 100%;
      height: 70px;
      background-color: white;
      border-radius: 4px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      transform: translateY(-100%);
      opacity: 0;
      animation: print-label 6s forwards;
      animation-delay: var(--delay, 0s);
    }
    
    @keyframes print-label {
      0% {
        transform: translateY(-100%);
        opacity: 0;
      }
      10%, 90% {
        transform: translateY(0);
        opacity: 1;
      }
      100% {
        transform: translateY(0);
        opacity: 1;
      }
    }
    
    .precinto-content {
      padding: 8px 12px;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      color: #333;
    }
    
    .precinto-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
    }
    
    .precinto-logo {
      font-weight: bold;
      color: #0a2e36;
    }
    
    .precinto-id {
      color: #666;
    }
    
    .precinto-data {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 5px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    
    .precinto-item {
      font-size: 0.65rem;
    }
    
    .precinto-barcode {
      height: 15px;
      background-image: linear-gradient(90deg, #000 2px, transparent 2px), linear-gradient(90deg, #000 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 8px 100%, 4px 100%;
      background-repeat: repeat-x;
      background-position: 0 0, 4px 0;
    }
    
    .printer-counter {
      position: absolute;
      top: -20px;
      right: -30px;
      background-color: rgba(10, 46, 54, 0.8);
      border-radius: 50%;
      width: 100px;
      height: 100px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      border: 2px solid rgba(59, 223, 180, 0.3);
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(59, 223, 180, 0.3);
    }
    
    .counter-value {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 2rem;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: var(--tracingpba-teal);
      line-height: 1;
    }
    
    .counter-label {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }
    
    .counter-time {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      color: white;
    }
    
    .command-screen {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: -30px;
      left: 30px;
      width: 250px;
      background-color: rgba(10, 30, 40, 0.9);
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4), 0 0 15px rgba(59, 223, 180, 0.2);
      border: 1px solid rgba(59, 223, 180, 0.3);
      transform: rotate(-5deg);
    }
    
    .command-header {
      background-color: rgba(10, 20, 26, 0.8);
      padding: 8px 12px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(59, 223, 180, 0.2);
    }
    
    .command-controls {
      display: flex;
      gap: 5px;
    }
    
    .command-controls span {
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    }
    
    .command-controls span:first-child {
      background-color: #e74c3c;
    }
    
    .command-title {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    }
    
    .command-body {
      padding: 12px;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      color: var(--tracingpba-teal);
    }
    
    .command-line {
      margin-bottom: 6px;
      opacity: 0;
      animation: show-line 5s forwards;
      animation-delay: calc(var(--index, 0) * 1s);
    }
    
    .command-line:nth-child(1) {
      --index: 0;
    }
    
    .command-line:nth-child(2) {
      --index: 1;
    }
    
    .command-line:nth-child(3) {
      --index: 2;
    }
    
    .command-line:nth-child(4) {
      --index: 3;
    }
    
    .command-line:nth-child(5) {
      --index: 4;
    }
    
    @keyframes show-line {
      0% {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(10px);
      }
      100% {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }
    
    .command-line.blink {
      animation: cursor-blink 1s infinite;
    }
    
    @keyframes cursor-blink {
      0%, 100% {
        opacity: 1;
      }
      50% {
        opacity: 0;
      }
    }
    
    /* Datos y flujo */
    .data-flow {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 1;
    }
    
    .data-line {
      position: absolute;
      height: 1px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--tracingpba-teal), transparent);
      opacity: 0.6;
    }
    
    .flow1 {
      width: 100px;
      top: 40%;
      left: -50px;
      transform: rotate(30deg);
      animation: data-flow 3s infinite alternate ease-in-out;
    }
    
    .flow2 {
      width: 80px;
      bottom: 30%;
      right: -40px;
      transform: rotate(-20deg);
      animation: data-flow 2.5s infinite alternate-reverse ease-in-out;
    }
    
    @keyframes data-flow {
      0% {
        opacity: 0.3;
        transform: translateX(0) rotate(30deg);
      }
      100% {
        opacity: 0.8;
        transform: translateX(20px) rotate(30deg);
      }
    }
    
    .data-dot {
      position: absolute;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background-color: var(--tracingpba-teal);
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(59, 223, 180, 0.8);
    }
    
    .dot1 {
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      top: 20%;
      left: 20%;
      opacity: 0.7;
      animation: pulse-dot 3s infinite alternate;
    }
    
    .dot2 {
      width: 6px;
      height: 6px;
      bottom: 40%;
      right: 15%;
      opacity: 0.6;
      animation: pulse-dot 2s infinite alternate-reverse;
    }
    
    .dot3 {
      width: 10px;
      height: 10px;
      top: 70%;
      left: 30%;
      opacity: 0.5;
      animation: pulse-dot 4s infinite alternate;
    }
    
    @keyframes pulse-dot {
      0% {
        transform: scale(1);
        opacity: 0.5;
      }
      100% {
        transform: scale(1.5);
        opacity: 0.8;
      }
    }
    
    /* Responsive */
    @media (max-width: 992px) {
      .precintos-content {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      
      .precintos-text {
        order: -1;
      }
      
      .printer-container {
        margin-top: 4rem;
      }
      
      .section-title {
        font-size: 2.2rem;
      }
    }
    
    @media (max-width: 768px) {
      .section-title {
        font-size: 2rem;
      }
      
      .printer-counter {
        width: 80px;
        height: 80px;
        top: -15px;
        right: -15px;
      }
      
      .counter-value {
        font-size: 1.5rem;
      }
      
      .counter-time {
        font-size: 1rem;
      }
      
      .command-screen {
        width: 200px;
        bottom: -20px;
        left: 20px;
      }
    }
    
    @media (max-width: 576px) {
      .precintos-features {
        gap: 1.5rem;
      }
      
      .feature-item {
        flex-direction: column;
      }
      
      .feature-icon {
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      }
      
      .section-title {
        font-size: 1.8rem;
      }
      
      .precintos-impact {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
      }
      
      .impact-metric, 
      .impact-clients {
        width: 100%;
      }
    }
  </style>